graph TD
    Start{{"🤔 New State<br/>Requirement"}}

    Q1{"Is this data from<br/>an external source?<br/>(API, WebSocket, NOSTR)"}
    Q2{"Is this UI/presentation<br/>state?<br/>(theme, modals, notifications)"}
    Q3{"Does this need to<br/>persist across<br/>page refreshes?"}
    Q4{"Is this shared<br/>across multiple<br/>components?"}

    RQ["✅ USE REACT QUERY<br/><br/>📦 Server State<br/>• API data fetching<br/>• Real-time updates<br/>• Background sync<br/>• Optimistic updates<br/>• Auto caching"]

    Redux1["✅ USE REDUX<br/><br/>🎨 UI State<br/>• Theme management<br/>• Modal state<br/>• Notifications<br/>• Sidebar state"]

    Redux2["✅ USE REDUX +<br/>LOCALSTORAGE<br/><br/>💾 Persistent State<br/>• User preferences<br/>• Settings<br/>• Session data"]

    Redux3["✅ USE REDUX or<br/>CONTEXT API<br/><br/>🔗 Shared State<br/>• Global flags<br/>• App-wide state"]

    Local["✅ USE LOCAL STATE<br/>(useState/useReducer)<br/><br/>🏠 Component State<br/>• Form inputs<br/>• Toggle states<br/>• Temporary UI"]

    Start --> Q1

    Q1 -->|YES| RQ
    Q1 -->|NO| Q2

    Q2 -->|YES| Redux1
    Q2 -->|NO| Q3

    Q3 -->|YES| Redux2
    Q3 -->|NO| Q4

    Q4 -->|YES| Redux3
    Q4 -->|NO| Local

    %% Examples
    RQ -.Example.-> Ex1["useCreators()<br/>useContent()<br/>usePayments()"]
    Redux1 -.Example.-> Ex2["theme: 'dark'<br/>activeModal: 'edit'<br/>notifications: []"]
    Redux2 -.Example.-> Ex3["userPreferences<br/>savedFilters<br/>recentSearches"]
    Redux3 -.Example.-> Ex4["featureFlags<br/>globalSettings"]
    Local -.Example.-> Ex5["inputValue<br/>isOpen<br/>selectedTab"]

